Subject: [PATCH] AI Pass 9: Land XML ranged/collateral combat, Camp-spam fix,
 GP EV math, 0-route trade projection, Espionage/RevDCM floors, and treasury
 priority

Add pure C++98 AIPlaystylePolicy.h and integrate across CvCityAI, CvPlayerAI,
CvUnitAI, and CvSelectionGroup without changing save format or exports:
- Block #1: projected trade-route base for 0-route cities, border-pop building
  before PROCESS_CULTURE, frontier Walls priority, peacetime core infrastructure
- Block #2: yield-ranked resource connector eliminating 400-time Camp spam over
  Pasture/Plantation, full Golden Age valuation (multipliers, anarchy-free civic
  swaps, +100% GP rate), unified Scientist/Engineer/General EV math, Food corp
  headroom weighting, affordable tangential tech-for-gold selling
- Block #3: land XML iAirRange valuation + legion mobility/March/chokepoint/
  Warlord traits in AI_unitValue, group-wide true-airRange damage targeting in
  AI_rangeAttack, pre-melee ranged volleys in groupAttack/AI_attackCityMove/
  AI_collateralMove/defensive chokepoints, safe circumstantial 2-move skirmish
  step-and-shoot and retreat, collateral cavalry/siege attack priority, turn-time
  ROI divisor in AI_bestUnitAI, coastal naval defense scaling
- Block #4: solvent 5-10% Espionage floor, Era 1+ RevDCM >= 50% research floor,
  EP-ratio Counter-Espionage and Switch Civic spy missions, yield-multiplier
  luxury 50% reservation share, mixed Resource + GPT luxury imports, urgent
  frontline upgrade reserve before AI_doGoldHurry

Serves: P19
